    {
      "id": "tf21-dc-note-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1094,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 369,
      "height": 81,
      "text": "💡 COMPATIBLE SALON TEXTE OU SALON FORUM DISCORD :\n• Salon classique : poste l'Embed coloré ci-dessus\n  (Rouge = Bug, Ambre = Suggestion, Bleu = Question).\n• Salon Forum Discord : crée automatiquement un\n  nouveau post intitulé « [BUG #TF-8F2A] Sujet... » !",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#a7f3d0",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
