    {
      "id": "tf21img-b3-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1104,
      "y": 1314,
      "width": 437,
      "height": 63,
      "text": "BARRIÈRE 3 — CLOUDFLARE WORKER + KV\n• Double contrôle binaire Header + Trailer (IEND / FFD9) ≤ 2.5 Mo\n• Scan anti-signature MZ / PK / <svg / <script + dims ≤ 4096px\n• 5 couches Anti-Spam (3/24h, 10 min, HMAC, anti-doublon SHA256)",
      "originalText": "BARRIÈRE 3 — CLOUDFLARE WORKER + KV\n• Double contrôle binaire Header + Trailer (IEND / FFD9) ≤ 2.5 Mo\n• Scan anti-signature MZ / PK / <svg / <script + dims ≤ 4096px\n• 5 couches Anti-Spam (3/24h, 10 min, HMAC, anti-doublon SHA256)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
